cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper listed under
  "preferred-citation".
title: cres-distance
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/leblanc-lab/cres-distance
abstract: >-
  Cell resampling of negatively weighted Monte Carlo events using
  optimal-transport-based distances (Energy Mover's Distance and its spectral
  variant), plus the Cross-Section Mover's Distance (XMD) as an unbinned
  measure of reweighting bias.
keywords:
  - negative weights
  - cell resampling
  - energy mover's distance
  - optimal transport
  - Monte Carlo event generation
